.termigo/

# Local Cargo registry/cache. This is CARGO_HOME scratch, never source: it was
# committed once by autoCheckpoint (commit c1393dfd "checkpoint: auto before
# run") and added 24,620 files / 325 MB, which made every `git worktree add`
# time out at 120s and broke subagent isolation. The nix package fetches release
# tarballs, not this directory, so nothing depends on tracking it.
.cargo/

